# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. A deliberately
# plain damage filler - core abilities, DoT refresh and target-count conditions only, no
# hero-talent branches. Anything the character does not know is dropped at runtime, and
# healing spells never reach the damage queue.

actions=flame_shock,if=refreshable
actions+=/lava_burst
actions+=/chain_lightning,if=active_enemies>=2
actions+=/lightning_bolt
